        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: redact dotted API key activity previews",
        "body": "﻿Closes #99459\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where users inspecting Control UI Activity output previews could see a raw dotted API key assignment when a tool emitted config/properties text containing keys such as `app.api.key=...`.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe Activity preview redactor already handled `apikey`, `api_key`, and `api-key`; this extends that same local preview rule to `api.key` while leaving the surrounding redaction behavior unchanged. A focused regression test exercises the production `updateActivityFromToolEvent` path that builds the Activity output preview.\n\n## User Impact\n\nOperators get safer Activity previews for config-style tool output: dotted API key assignments are masked, while non-sensitive config lines continue to display normally.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource-level before proof against the previous Activity preview regex:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"before\": \"app.api.key=visible-leaked-value-1234567890\\nserver.port=8080\",\n  \"after\": \"app.api.key=[redacted]\\nserver.port=8080\"\n}\n```\n\nAfter-fix terminal proof from the production Activity preview path on this branch. The command imports `updateActivityFromToolEvent` from `ui/src/ui/activity-model.ts`, feeds a fake tool-result config dump through it, and inspects the resulting Activity entry preview:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"activityEntryCount\": 1,\n  \"activityStatus\": \"done\",\n  \"outputPreview\": \"app.api.key=[redacted]\\nspring.datasource.password=[redacted]\\nserver.port=8080\",\n  \"rawApiKeyPresent\": false,\n  \"rawPasswordPresent\": false,\n  \"nonSensitiveLinePresent\": true\n}\n```\n\nValidation after the patch:\n\n- `node --import tsx -` with the production `updateActivityFromToolEvent` proof above\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui.config.ts ui/src/ui/activity-model.test.ts` - 1 test passed\n- `pnpm exec oxlint ui/src/ui/activity-model.ts ui/src/ui/activity-model.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `python .agents\\skills\\autoreview\\scripts\\autoreview --mode local` - clean, no accepted/actionable findings\r\n",
        "branch": "fix/activity-dotted-api-redaction",
        "head_sha": "71f2a555e090cd11c26565c53f7a3b2a5f225aa4",
        "author": "ooiuuii",
